  "id": "tangible-user-interface",
  "term": "tangible user interface",
  "definition": "A tangible user interface is a touch-based interface technology in which physical form and haptic qualities are used to support interaction. In this approach, the feel of controls can help users orient themselves, distinguish functions, and make the interface more intuitive.",
